infographic compare-binary-horizontal-underline-text-vs
data
  title Opaque session vs self-contained JWT
  desc Two auth models that fail in opposite directions
  compares
    - label Opaque session
      children
        - label Revocable instantly
          desc DEL session:id logs out the next request
        - label Per-request store lookup
          desc Sub-ms local Redis, real cross-region latency
        - label State lives server-side
          desc Cookie holds only a 128-bit random id
        - label HttpOnly cookie, XSS cannot read it
          desc Invisible to document.cookie
    - label Self-contained JWT
      children
        - label Cannot un-issue
          desc Valid until exp no matter what
        - label No lookup, scales flat
          desc Verify signature, zero shared state
        - label Claims travel in the token
          desc header.payload.signature, signed
        - label localStorage, XSS exfiltrates it
          desc One injected line POSTs the token
theme
  palette #6366f1 #f43f5e
